{"version":2,"slug":"how-to-introduce-yourself-in-english-speak-like-a-native","videoId":"vmp3VYsBW88","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/vmp3VYsBW88","lang":"en","title":"How to Introduce Yourself in English | Speak Like a Native!","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Hello."},{"start":1,"text":"And welcome back to my slow English"},{"start":6,"text":"podcast. This is a place"},{"start":9,"text":"where you can listen"},{"start":12,"text":"to slow"},{"start":14,"text":"clear English. English you can feel."},{"start":19,"text":"Not just memorize. Remember, speed this"},{"start":24,"text":"video up to 1.5"},{"start":27,"text":"if you want"},{"start":29,"text":"a challenge."},{"start":30,"text":"Today,"},{"start":32,"text":"we are learning how to introduce"},{"start":37,"text":"ourselves. Now, not in a basic way."},{"start":43,"text":"Not just your name"},{"start":46,"text":"or your job."},{"start":48,"text":"Today,"},{"start":49,"text":"we will learn how to introduce the"},{"start":54,"text":"deeper parts of ourselves."},{"start":58,"text":"If you are intermediate or advanced,"},{"start":62,"text":"then this episode is for you."},{"start":65,"text":"Follow along with me."},{"start":68,"text":"Speak out [snorts] loud. Pause when you"},{"start":73,"text":"need to."},{"start":74,"text":"And comment your answers."},{"start":78,"text":"I'll read them all."},{"start":80,"text":"And shout out to my top commenters on my"},{"start":84,"text":"last video"},{"start":86,"text":"from Uzbekistan,"},{"start":88,"text":"Brazil,"},{"start":90,"text":"and Bangladesh."},{"start":92,"text":"Thank you, as always, for being here."},{"start":95,"text":"Thank you for your support. So,"},{"start":98,"text":"who am I? Today, I want to introduce"},{"start":103,"text":"myself to you."},{"start":105,"text":"Not just my name,"},{"start":108,"text":"but my story."},{"start":112,"text":"My name is Tayana Ortiz."},{"start":116,"text":"That is the name I was given, but it's"},{"start":120,"text":"not the whole story. I am someone"},{"start":124,"text":"who has lived between cultures,"},{"start":129,"text":"between places that both feel like home."},{"start":134,"text":"I don't just want to introduce myself."},{"start":138,"text":"I want to tell you what shaped me. First"},{"start":143,"text":"things first,"},{"start":144,"text":"my name, Tiana,"},{"start":147,"text":"means the most beautiful flower,"},{"start":151,"text":"according to my parents."},{"start":154,"text":"I'm not so sure about it, but I know it"},{"start":160,"text":"is of Aztec origin."},{"start":163,"text":"I was born in the United States,"},{"start":165,"text":"Nebraska, and that is where my life"},{"start":169,"text":"started. But, of course, a home is not"},{"start":174,"text":"always permanent. When I was 8 years"},{"start":179,"text":"old,"},{"start":180,"text":"my dad"},{"start":181,"text":"was deported"},{"start":183,"text":"back to Mexico. So,"},{"start":186,"text":"everything changed."},{"start":189,"text":"My life turned upside down."},{"start":195,"text":"And I think that moment"},{"start":199,"text":"taught me a lot"},{"start":202,"text":"about loss,"},{"start":205,"text":"adaptation,"},{"start":207,"text":"and resilience. It taught me how fast"},{"start":213,"text":"life can change, but how strong"},{"start":218,"text":"we are deep down, and how capable we are"},{"start":223,"text":"of adapting to change. Now,"},{"start":227,"text":"when you introduce yourself,"},{"start":230,"text":"you can ask,"},{"start":232,"text":"Where am I from?"},{"start":235,"text":"And what formed me?"},{"start":238,"text":"What experience changed you?"},{"start":242,"text":"What moment made you grow up"},{"start":246,"text":"faster?"},{"start":247,"text":"What place in the world"},{"start":250,"text":"taught you who you are?"},{"start":254,"text":"Tell me about it."},{"start":255,"text":"Write it down in the comments."},{"start":258,"text":"I attended"},{"start":260,"text":"a bilingual school."},{"start":263,"text":"They taught English and Spanish."},{"start":268,"text":"Not very good Spanish, but nevertheless,"},{"start":273,"text":"they taught"},{"start":274,"text":"me something. All the basics that I"},{"start":277,"text":"would need to survive, basically."},{"start":282,"text":"My sister wasn't so lucky."},{"start":286,"text":"She didn't know any Spanish when we"},{"start":290,"text":"arrived."},{"start":292,"text":"And my sister"},{"start":293,"text":"entered into middle school."},{"start":298,"text":"And that's a rough year"},{"start":302,"text":"to enter a new school. Now, add on the"},{"start":307,"text":"pressure of not knowing your classmates'"},{"start":312,"text":"language."},{"start":314,"text":"It was difficult for her. But, I feel"},{"start":318,"text":"especially"},{"start":320,"text":"sympathetic for my sister."},{"start":322,"text":"I was able to pick up the language"},{"start":326,"text":"pretty quick."},{"start":327,"text":"Since I was 8 years old,"},{"start":331,"text":"it came naturally. But, at the"},{"start":334,"text":"beginning,"},{"start":336,"text":"it was difficult."},{"start":338,"text":"Don't get me wrong."},{"start":340,"text":"I definitely struggled making friends"},{"start":345,"text":"and relating to people at first."},{"start":349,"text":"I went through all of elementary school,"},{"start":354,"text":"middle school,"},{"start":355,"text":"and high school in Mexico."},{"start":358,"text":"But,"},{"start":360,"text":"I did not go to university. I learned"},{"start":363,"text":"through experiences."},{"start":366,"text":"Through making mistakes."},{"start":369,"text":"Through work"},{"start":371,"text":"and through lots of curiosity. Curiosity"},{"start":376,"text":"for the world in general."},{"start":379,"text":"I traveled a lot."},{"start":382,"text":"And I learned that education does not"},{"start":385,"text":"only live in a classroom,"},{"start":389,"text":"but it lives in conversations."},{"start":393,"text":"In travel."},{"start":395,"text":"In culture. In failing, but trying"},{"start":399,"text":"again. In stepping out"},{"start":402,"text":"of your comfort zone. Something I"},{"start":405,"text":"learned to do was to be inspired"},{"start":410,"text":"instead of envious. So now,"},{"start":414,"text":"when I feel I'm judging someone,"},{"start":417,"text":"and I know I'm envious of them, I decide"},{"start":422,"text":"to feel inspired."},{"start":425,"text":"I take action"},{"start":427,"text":"on what I need in my life."},{"start":431,"text":"On what my body is telling me I need"},{"start":435,"text":"because I'm judging that other person."},{"start":439,"text":"Now, it's your turn."},{"start":441,"text":"What's something that you've learned"},{"start":444,"text":"about yourself"},{"start":446,"text":"outside"},{"start":448,"text":"of the classroom?"},{"start":450,"text":"How do you learn best?"},{"start":453,"text":"Through structure"},{"start":455,"text":"or freedom?"},{"start":457,"text":"Through books or life? If you did study"},{"start":461,"text":"something in school,"},{"start":463,"text":"what's something it taught you about"},{"start":466,"text":"yourself?"},{"start":468,"text":"Not just about the subject."},{"start":471,"text":"What's something you learned about"},{"start":474,"text":"yourself"},{"start":475,"text":"in the classroom?"},{"start":477,"text":"Let me know in the comments. I'm really"},{"start":480,"text":"curious to hear your stories."},{"start":483,"text":"I work as an English teacher."},{"start":488,"text":"But that's not the full truth. What I"},{"start":492,"text":"really do"},{"start":494,"text":"is make people feel"},{"start":497,"text":"safe."},{"start":500,"text":"Safe using their voice."},{"start":503,"text":"I help people feel less afraid."},{"start":508,"text":"Afraid of being misunderstood."},{"start":514,"text":"I hate it"},{"start":516,"text":"when someone is learning a language"},{"start":519,"text":"and you can see they're learning a"},{"start":522,"text":"language"},{"start":524,"text":"and there's always that one person who"},{"start":527,"text":"acts like they can't understand what"},{"start":530,"text":"you're saying."},{"start":532,"text":"Or they don't make the efforts to try to"},{"start":537,"text":"understand what you're saying."},{"start":540,"text":"They'll say, \"Huh?"},{"start":542,"text":"What? I can't understand your accent.\""},{"start":545,"text":"And that's what I'm here"},{"start":548,"text":"to destroy that belief"},{"start":550,"text":"that maybe someone else made you think."},{"start":556,"text":"Being soft,"},{"start":559,"text":"being patient,"},{"start":562,"text":"being kind,"},{"start":565,"text":"as we should, what you're doing is a"},{"start":568,"text":"very courageous thing to even attempt."},{"start":574,"text":"And you need to feel proud of yourself."},{"start":579,"text":"I'm here to help you tune out"},{"start":583,"text":"all the people who want to discourage"},{"start":587,"text":"you. Teaching is not just my job. It's"},{"start":592,"text":"how I connect,"},{"start":594,"text":"how I listen,"},{"start":597,"text":"and how I have learned so many things."},{"start":603,"text":"So many."},{"start":604,"text":"Just from teaching online. Now,"},{"start":608,"text":"ask yourself,"},{"start":611,"text":"what do you really do"},{"start":614,"text":"beyond your title?"},{"start":618,"text":"What problem do you solve?"},{"start":622,"text":"What do others come to you for?"},{"start":627,"text":"What kind of energy do you bring"},{"start":632,"text":"to the room?"},{"start":633,"text":"Don't let those discouragers get the"},{"start":636,"text":"best of you."},{"start":637,"text":"Listen to me instead."},{"start":641,"text":"I speak English and Spanish,"},{"start":645,"text":"and I'm learning Chinese."},{"start":647,"text":"You guys know this."},{"start":649,"text":"Language changed my life."},{"start":653,"text":"It changed how I think,"},{"start":656,"text":"how I express emotion,"},{"start":660,"text":"how I connect with people."},{"start":664,"text":"Every language I learn"},{"start":667,"text":"teaches me"},{"start":668,"text":"a new version of myself."},{"start":671,"text":"Does this happen to you yet?"},{"start":675,"text":"Maybe with another language, or maybe"},{"start":678,"text":"with English. Maybe the more you learn,"},{"start":683,"text":"the more you'll discover your new"},{"start":686,"text":"personality."},{"start":688,"text":"Because"},{"start":689,"text":"[laughter and gasps]"},{"start":689.6,"text":"I feel like I have two personalities."},{"start":693,"text":"One in English and one in Spanish,"},{"start":697,"text":"for sure."},{"start":699,"text":"Your turn."},{"start":700,"text":"How has language shaped you? Which"},{"start":704,"text":"language feels like home?"},{"start":707,"text":"And which language feels like growth?"},{"start":711,"text":"What do I love?"},{"start":715,"text":"I love walking through cities,"},{"start":720,"text":"biking through cities,"},{"start":724,"text":"when there's no traffic,"},{"start":726,"text":"with my headphones on,"},{"start":729,"text":"listening to my favorite songs, stopping"},{"start":734,"text":"by small shops or markets, and having"},{"start":741,"text":"quiet"},{"start":743,"text":"moments. I need to slow down."},{"start":750,"text":"We all need to slow down sometimes."},{"start":756,"text":"Reminds me"},{"start":758,"text":"that my life doesn't need to be super"},{"start":763,"text":"productive"},{"start":765,"text":"to be meaningful."},{"start":768,"text":"I love traveling and learning new"},{"start":772,"text":"things, not to escape, but to understand"},{"start":778,"text":"more and more about myself."},{"start":782,"text":"It's so important to get to know"},{"start":785,"text":"yourself."},{"start":786,"text":"Now, your turn."},{"start":789,"text":"What do you love? What activity"},{"start":793,"text":"makes time"},{"start":795,"text":"disappear? What brings you back to"},{"start":799,"text":"yourself"},{"start":803,"text":"heavy? Now,"},{"start":806,"text":"take your time."},{"start":808,"text":"Reflect on each question."},{"start":812,"text":"You don't need to be perfect to start."},{"start":816,"text":"You just need to start"},{"start":819,"text":"and try"},{"start":821,"text":"and make mistakes. You know this."},{"start":824,"text":"Repeat."},{"start":826,"text":"Pause."},{"start":827,"text":"Think. And if you want, ask me questions"},{"start":831,"text":"in the comments. But mostly"},{"start":834,"text":"tell me about yourself. Let me get to"},{"start":837,"text":"know you better."},{"start":840,"text":"And remember, guys,"},{"start":842,"text":"never stop learning."},{"start":846,"text":"Bye."},{"start":857,"text":"[music]"}]}